    "heading": "2-solar-ingress-sankranti",
    "content": "**Mesha Sankranti (Aries Ingress)**: Marks the entrance of the Sun into the constellation of Mesha (Aries). This exact astronomical occurrence defines **Baisakh 1**, celebrating **Nepali New Year (*Nawa Barsha*)**."
  }, {
    "heading": "2-solar-ingress-sankranti",
