  "contents": [{
    "heading": undefined,
    "content": "The `NepaliDate` constructor creates instances representing specific points in time mapped to the Bikram Sambat calendar system. You can construct an instance representing the current moment, provide separate year, month, and day integers, supply a standard date string, or pass a native JavaScript Date object. Bikram Sambat months are indexed starting from 0 for Baisakh through 11 for Chaitra."
  }, {
    "heading": "1-no-arguments",
    "content": "Constructs an instance set to the current system date and time."
