    "content": "**Strict TypeScript Types**: Fully typed with comprehensive IntelliSense and autocomplete."
  }, {
    "heading": "core-capabilities",
    "content": "**Zero Runtime Dependencies**: Ultra-lightweight footprint suitable for Node.js, React, Next.js, and edge workers."
  }, {
    "heading": "core-capabilities",
    "content": "**Bidirectional Conversion**: Accurate conversion between Gregorian (AD) and Bikram Sambat (BS) from 1976 to 2100 BS."
  }, {
    "heading": "core-capabilities",
    "content": "**Date Arithmetic**: Add and subtract days, months, and years with accurate month-day boundary clamping."
  }, {
    "heading": "core-capabilities",
    "content": "**Fiscal Year Engine**: Built-in calculation for Nepali fiscal years (Shrawan to Ashadh) and financial quarters."
  }, {
    "heading": "core-capabilities",
    "content": "**Devanagari Localization**: Native formatting with Nepali numerals (`२०८१`), month names (`कार्तिक`), and weekdays (`शुक्रबार`)."
